{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40111,"sections":[{"id":"script-20111","name":"原始脚本 20111","scripts":[20111],"start":0,"count":17}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20111:20111:0","scriptId":20111,"text":"和计划一样，一个接一个的钢舞姬数据都倒下了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20111:20111:1","scriptId":20111,"text":"终于……最后一个倒下的模拟化佐伊也变为数据链消失在模拟世界中……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20111:20111:2","scriptId":20111,"text":"我们一行人都瘫软在地上。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20111:20111:3","scriptId":20111,"text":"“要死要死……还以为死定了……利用教官喜欢单打独斗的性格，只要有队员在场就发挥不了最大能力……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":577,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20111:20111:4","scriptId":20111,"text":"“根据长官的指令，果然留着佐伊到最后处理是最方便的，她这个命中能力……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":577,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":590,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20111:20111:5","scriptId":20111,"text":"“呼呼……是啊……姐姐这个……就算放在那里也打不中你……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":590,"right":577,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20111:20111:6","scriptId":20111,"text":"“数据有点老，佐伊现在的命中能力还行了……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":590,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20111:20111:7","scriptId":20111,"text":"“维卡最后那一炮漂亮，直接命中教官的死角。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":590,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20111:20111:8","scriptId":20111,"text":"“恩……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":596,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20111:20111:9","scriptId":20111,"text":"这时——刚才在战斗时不知道消失到哪去的波西娅又重新出现了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":596,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20111:20111:10","scriptId":20111,"text":"“很好，连索菲亚教官都干掉了，我给你们带来了一些补给品，再接再厉～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20111:20111:11","scriptId":20111,"text":"“再接再厉？？难道……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20111:20111:12","scriptId":20111,"text":"“恩～就是那个‘难道’……刚才已经查到入侵的数据莫名其妙的消失了，从我的数据库里拿了走不少数据……当然那也没什么，反正都是些备用的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20111:20111:13","scriptId":20111,"text":"“不过还有最后一批钢舞姬数据往这里来了，大概还要半小时就能抵达吧～就拜托你们咯～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20111:20111:14","scriptId":20111,"text":"“只要不是教官一切好说……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20111:20111:15","scriptId":20111,"text":"“恩～我已经查过，没有索菲亚教授的数据啦～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20111:20111:16","scriptId":20111,"text":"“呼……那就好……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
